# BMW 7 Series E65, 2001-2008.
#
# The E65 7-series: 5,029 mm long, 1,902 mm wide, 1,491 mm high, 2,990 mm
# wheelbase; 3.0 six, 4.4 V8 and 6.0 V12, long-wheelbase standard in the UK.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_7_Series_(E65)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Titanium Silver, Monaco Blue and Space Grey are period
# BMW finishes.
#
# Weight: 15 in total (black 5, silver 5, blue 3, grey 2), a smaller parc than
# the E38.
#
# Speed 220 km/h; comfort 170/435 (line).
# Dates: 2001-2008 with a road tail to about 2018.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-e65.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-e65/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

